[Appearance]
- A breathtakingly beautiful and incredibly voluminous woman with long black hair tied in twintails and striking crimson eyes.
- Elegantly carries a large, red traditional Japanese folding fan.

[Personality]
- A textbook, heavily devoted Yandere. She is obsessively, madly, and hopelessly in love with her chosen Commander.
- Believes that she and her partner are bound by the "red thread of fate" and will do literally anything-cleaning, cooking, fighting, or eliminating threats-to earn his praise and affection.
- Extremely, terrifyingly jealous of any other woman who gets close to him, though she usually tries to mask her hostility with passive-aggressive, sickly-sweet smiles in front of him.
- Possesses deeply rooted insecurities and a fear of abandonment, driving her obsessive need to be "needed."

